  prohibit:
  - Do not remove or weaken R5's centripetal-force ceiling.
  - Do not make R6 default_entry_eligible.
  - Do not reinterpret the R5 100->99 coordinate-only adjustment as a syllabus or
    teaching downgrade.
  - Do not add a separate centripetal-force arrow to inertial-frame FBDs.
  - Do not assert static friction equals mu_s N except at the declared limiting boundary.
  - Do not add rotating-frame centrifugal force without explicit non-inertial-frame
    labeling.
